{"type":"event","event":{"type":"tool_completed","toolCallId":"call_847e92670f774876a8f9c949","toolName":"grep","result":[{"type":"text","text":"src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc:1105:(defn- link-step!\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1106-  \"One driver step of the link at `now`: record `now`, drain (within\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1107-   the drain budget), then, when an outstanding or kept request is\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1108-   past its deadline, emit channel-expired for the least such id and\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1109-   lose the channel (channel-loss!). The link reads no clock: `now` is\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1110-   the driver's. Answers whether the channel is gone and the id that\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1111-   expired, if any.\"\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1112-  [link now]\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1113-  (swap! link assoc :now now)\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1114-  (drain! link)\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1115-  (let [{:keys [outstanding pending channel-gone?]} @link\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1116-        overdue (when-not channel-gone?\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1117-                  (->> (concat outstanding pending)\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1118-                       (filter (fn [[_ e]]\nsrc/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1119-                                 (some-> (:deadline e) (<= now))))\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1120-                       (sort-by key)\n/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-stream-s2/src/cljc/dao/stream/remote.cljc-1121-      