ws_project.cljc` `establish!` | A request that first exists on the link **before any timed step never receives a deadline**, even after the driver starts stepping with `now`. The `establish!` fix covers only dials already stepped at a `now`; a driver that attaches first and steps later leaves the attach probe — the establishment stall Expiry bounds — undying. Follows the spec's letter (\"before any step with `now`, nothing is stamped\"); the spec is silent on backfill. | Record for the Architect: document that drivers must step with `now` before first attach/resolve, or amend the spec to backfill deadlines at the first timed step. Non-blocking for S2c; matters for the S3a driver. |\n| 3 | P4 | `remote.cljc` `send-named!` | `(new-deadline link)` computed twice in the `cond->`. Pure and correct under driver discipline, but fragile. | `"}]}}
