ds stamp via `register!` (`send-request!`, `refl-append`, `send-named!`); kept probes carry their original deadline because `send-request!` does the **pending lookup first** — never restamped on retry or eventual send (verified in `a-kept-probe-has-a-deadline`); waiting `:probe` entries are unstamped until `admit-probe!`; `count-ask!` touches only `:asks`, never `:deadline`; `absorb!`/`absorb-named!` remove the entry, deadline included. All exactly per spec.\n\n**`link-step!` / `:step`.** Order matches the spec: record `:now`, budgeted `drain!`, then — skipped when `channel-g"}]}}
