type hazard is finding 1's `(<= deadline nil)`.\n\n**`ws_project.cljc` — `dial`.** Policy `select-keys` gains `give-up-after`; namespaced-key-only per spec; `dial-propagates-link-options` verifies all four link keys land on"}]}}
